            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Aki 0.4.1</h2>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>The message typed to your agent names exactly the marks it records as delivered.</li>
<li>Coming back to an Orca tab through one with no agent makes it the destination again.</li>
<li>esc and ⌘⏎ still work after switching apps while writing a comment.</li>
<li>The commands in the message use each mark's full code, so two marks can't be confused.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
